The development brief explicitly reserves the license choice for the project owner.
Until a license is added by the owner, treat this repository as “all rights reserved”
and do not publish binaries or source under an assumed license.

See `docs/decisions/DEFERRED.md` and `docs/reports/release-readiness.md` for the
release blocker this creates.

